      <title>ভেজাল নয়! গম দিয়ে বাড়িতেই তৈরি করে নিন খাঁটি ডালিয়া</title>
      <link>https://www.aajkaal.in/lifestyle/how-to-make-homemade-daliya-from-wheat-522276</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aajkaal.in/lifestyle/how-to-make-homemade-daliya-from-wheat-522276</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 28 Nov 2026 21:06:00 +0530</pubDate>
